SUMMARY:The ICONS Tour
DESCRIPTION:Meet the icons of the NC Museum of Natural Sciences. Join an experienced staff educator on a journey through the highlights to explore the science and stories of our favorite exhibits and specimens. \nThe tour begins at 11 AM and lasts approximately 1 hour. \nPre-registration is required\, and closes 1 hour prior to the start time. This program is for ages 12 and up and all children under 18 must be accompanied by a registered adult. Tour group limited to 15 participants. Ticket sales end one hour before the tour begins. \nClick the preferred date below to purchase tickets. \n11:00 AM Saturday September 26\, 2026 \n11:00 AM Saturday November 7\, 202611:00 AM Saturday November 14\, 202611:00 AM Saturday November 21\, 2026 \n11:00 AM Saturday December 5\, 202611:00 AM Saturday December 12\, 202611:00 AM Saturday December 19\, 2026 \nTickets: $12\, Free for Museum Members. Not a member yet? Join today! \nCorporate & Team-Building Tours \nInterested in an insider’s look at the Museum – with an expert guide all to yourself – for your corporate outing or team-building activity? Contact us!
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/the-icons-tour/2026-09-26/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,K-12 Students,Museum Untold Tours
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Smith":MAILTO:christopher.smith@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
