SUMMARY:Meal Prep Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Come help the Museum’s Green Team celebrate Food Waste Prevention Week with a workshop on meal prep! \nTake the stress out of mealtime! Learn simple\, practical ways to plan your meals\, organize your grocery shopping\, and prep ahead—so you can spend less time wondering “What’s for dinner?” and more time enjoying meals with the people you love. Whether you’re feeding a family or just trying to make your week run smoother\, you’ll leave with tools and strategies you can actually use. Participants will leave with their own salad in a jar\, that they will prep during the session! \nWorkshop is free but registration is required. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/food-prep-workshop/
LOCATION:Nature Research Center\, 121 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Natural World Investigate Lab,Workshops
